==English==

===Etymology===
From {{term|psycho-|lang=en}} + {{term|analysis|lang=en}}, after German {{term|Psychoanalyse|lang=de}}.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{context|psychoanalysis|lang=en}} a family of theories and methods within the field of [[psychotherapy]] that work to find connections among patients' unconscious mental processes

